 ,THE ROLE OF PLANTS IN CLIMATE CHANGE

  ,THE ,EARTH IS GETTING HOTTER BECAUSE
OF THE THINGS PEOPLE DO4 ,PLANTS HELP TO
BRING ITS TEMPERATURE DOWN4 ,THEY KEEP
THE AIR CLEAN1 MAKE THE WEATHER PLEASANT
AND MAKE THE ENVIRONMENT BEAUTIFUL4
  ,FOR THIS1 WE SHOULD DO THESE THINGS3
,WE SHOULD PLANT AS MANY TREES AS WE
  CAN4
,WE SHOULD SAVE FORESTS FROM CATCHING
  FIRE4
,WE SHOULD TAKE CARE OF TREES AND
  PLANTS4
,WE SHOULD NOT CUT DOWN TREES WITHOUT A
  REASON4
  ,PICTURE3 ,A PICTURE OF THE ,EARTH AS
A GLOBE4 ,ON THE RIGHT1 BLACK SMOKE
RISES FROM FACTORIES AND CARS AND
SPREADS OVER THE ,EARTH1 AND RED ARROWS
SHOW ITS PATH4 ,ON THE LEFT ARE A GREEN
TREE1 PLANTS AND A MAN4 ,PLANTS HELP TO
STOP THIS SMOKE4

               ,ACTIVITY

  ,WITH YOUR TEACHER'S HELP1 HOLD A
TREE-PLANTING WEEK AT SCHOOL4 ,CHILDREN
SHOULD PLANT SAPLINGS1 WATER THE
SAPLINGS THEY HAVE PLANTED REGULARLY1
AND KEEP THEM SAFE4
#A4 ,TOGETHER WITH YOUR TEACHER1 CHOOSE
  A PLACE AT SCHOOL TO PLANT A SAPLING4
#B4 ,DIG A HOLE1 PUT THE SAPLING IN AND
  PRESS THE SOIL DOWN AROUND IT4
#C4 ,WATER THE PLANT AND PUT A LABEL
  WITH YOUR NAME BESIDE IT4
#D4 ,WATER YOUR PLANT EVERY DAY FOR THE
  WHOLE WEEK AND KEEP IT SAFE4

             ,HELPFUL HINTS

,FOR EVERYONE3 ,LOOK AT THE PICTURE IN
  TWO HALVES4 ,ON THE RIGHT THERE IS
  SMOKE FROM CARS AND FACTORIES4 ,ON THE
  LEFT THERE IS A GREEN TREE4 ,TREES
  CLEAN THE AIR4
,FOR EVERYONE3 ,ON A HOT DAY1 STAND IN
  THE SHADE OF A TREE AND THEN IN THE
  SUN4 ,FEEL THE DIFFERENCE3 IT IS
  COOLER UNDER THE TREE4
,MOVEMENT3 ,IF DIGGING THE HOLE IS HARD1
  YOU CAN PUT THE SEED OR SAPLING IN THE
  HOLE1 OR WATER IT WITH A SMALL
  WATERING CAN4 ,YOU CAN ALSO PLANT IT
  IN A POT ON A TABLE4
,FOR TEACHERS3 ,DURING TREE PLANTING1
  GIVE EVERY CHILD A JOB3 ONE CHOOSES
  THE PLACE1 ONE ADDS THE SOIL1 ONE
  WATERS1 AND ONE MAKES THE NAME LABEL4
